<title>USA: NY cert cotton stocks fall 5,269 bales to 106,197.</title>
<headline>NY cert cotton stocks fall 5,269 bales to 106,197.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 28 totaled 106,197 bales, down from 111,466 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, three bales awaiting review, 5,269 cancellations,  and 2,626 decertification orders.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
